      "descriptions": [
        {
          "description": "<p> SCADA data with a time resolution of 10min for four wind turbines of Saint-Hilaire wind farm (T2,\nT3, T5, T6). Data available from 01/12/2020 to 14/01/2024. The hub height variables available are : active power, wind speed, wind direction, external temperature, speed of low-speed shaft, speed of high-speed shaft, blade ange, generator torque, reference generator torque.  </p>\n"
        }
